# Konjam Coding — learn

Before changing this site, read `docs/README.md`.

- Astro + Starlight, static, Cloudflare Pages. This is the **public** repo for
  `learn.konjamcoding.me`. The private `KonjamCoding/website` repo is `konjamcoding.me`.
- Keep this repo public. giscus comments are GitHub Discussions and are unreadable on a
  private repo.
- `src/styles/tokens.css`, `public/logo*.png`, `public/favicon.png` and
  `src/assets/logo.png` are GENERATED by `npm run sync:brand` in the website repo.
  Do not edit them here. `src/styles/starlight-theme.css` is the file to edit.
- A tutorial is one Markdown file under `src/content/docs/`. Use the `testedOn` and
  `youtube` frontmatter; they render the strip under the title.
- A new sidebar group must be `{ label, items: [{ autogenerate: { directory } }] }`.
  Starlight 0.39 removed `label` directly on an `autogenerate` object.
- Tutorials are English. Do not machine-translate into Tamil; that waits for a paid human
  translator. Code, commands and errors stay English regardless.
- No legal name, no personal email, no personal domain, anywhere, including commit
  messages. Author is "Konjam Coding". No politics, religion, or caste.
- `dist/_headers` is generated from `config/headers.template` AFTER the build, hashing
  every inline script that actually shipped, so there is no `unsafe-inline`. Any new
  third-party script, font, image host or embed must be added to the template or it is
  blocked silently. After a Starlight upgrade, check the site under the real CSP: a
  blocked inline script renders fine and just stops working.
- Plain white / near-black, one typeface (Inter, Anek Tamil for Tamil). Orange marks one
  thing at a time, never a surface.
- Ask before pushing to `main`.
